changed and toddy has joined the family .. and he''s the total opposite .. i think he actually enjoys having his photo taken .. sometimes he actually gets a treat for sitting or begging or doing the meerkat when i take his photo .. anyway .. thanks again .. i felt this would go really well in the challenge .. but when i look at it now with the eyes of the voters i see it with different eyes .. altho i preferred the eyes i had before .. ;)', '2021-03-24 02:52:13.000000', NULL, 0);
